file a common file?  Or does somebody have a copy of this file who could EMail it
to me?

Answer:
-------
"flex" and "bison" are the utilities that are executed when configuring the code
for compiling for the "gcc" compiler.

"lex" and "yacc" are the utilities that are executed when configuring the code
for compiling for the "cc" compiler.

Since this is the case I was satified with just "lex" and "yacc".

"tokdefs.h" gets created when "configure" gets executed for the library.  Thank 
you "Herve DEMARTHE (CEA France) <demarthe@alpha.cad.cea.fr>" for a copy of the 
file anyway.

